Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:06.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:17.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:22.44,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:26.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:33.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:40.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:48.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:54.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:58.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:02.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:09.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:20.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出来 椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.93,0:01:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是那个椿没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪一个椿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前和桔梗姐姐并驾齐驱的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 那个巫女是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.73,0:02:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是椿小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到她变成了黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的事情怎样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙现在在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:27.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感受到四魂之玉在这里最深处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我记得这地方是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说这里曾经封印着鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.19,0:02:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第64话 多宝塔的巨大鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 臭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:38.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会加害你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:39.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何？愿意为我生孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何？愿意为我生孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对象是谁都可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:56.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 我不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.23,0:03:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们醒过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了吗 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不应该这样子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝一直照顾着你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为戈薇吩咐我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能对你们两人出手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此是七宝在照顾你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是太多管闲事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙不是坏妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有害过人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:31.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是巫女 会认为妖怪统统都是坏蛋也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:37.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尾巴尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耳朵耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:45.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍耐一下让她们了解你并不是坏妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 为什么袭击椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 那个叫犬夜叉的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是邪恶的坏蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:04.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为椿企图咒杀戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:05.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿告诉你们什么我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:12.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她现在是诅咒别人的黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:20.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没啥大不了的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确不像是刚才颇具威力的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:29.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿的力量减弱了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:31.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她明明有四魂之玉呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概不知道怎么使用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么塔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们的葬身之地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿果然有与奈落联手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落也有份是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你和椿狠狠的揍一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可别太心急了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要当你们对手的不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来看你们的死状而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么大不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:38.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙也不过是人偶罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还挺有两下子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:52.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这招如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子你不是只来看戏的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:09.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来打发时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:30.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:42.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 接下来换你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿那边先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 是四魂之玉的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:38.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里布下了结界 似乎曾经封印了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:40.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而封印已经被解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:42.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚才的式神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是封印那些的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不需要这么牢固的封印的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正进去就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位椿师姐居然是黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种话我们才不信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:05.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两位和椿是同门弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会这么想是当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你们到那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲眼见识真相如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点走吧 两位要抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道在高兴什么 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启鬼之门 招来金色之神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:55.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胆敢将我封印…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就赐给你力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的力量在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 不想要这股力量吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:13.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:17.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:38.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼啊 鬼的力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:44.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:46.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们啊 我一直在等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将四魂之玉还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 它的确很了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉就在椿的右眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,右眼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.95,0:11:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到它居然有这么强的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这颗四魂之玉回到我身边的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 你在那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和桔梗姐姐发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这统统都是桔梗的错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个假正经的冷酷巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本没资格说桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:34.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:38.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 妖怪接下来是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只右眼里又养了什么怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是充沛 真是充沛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丰沛的鬼之力充满我的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么门会…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁忌的多宝塔居然打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:09.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁忌的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是四魂之玉的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:45.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是鬼所拥有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到我获得的力量 吓的说不出话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印被打破了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是椿师姐解开封印
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有这股力量 我终于能永恒不灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个退开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:26.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股力量真是太美妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:32.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.75,0:13:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然空手挡住铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用 没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.93,0:14:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…竟然承受住了风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话 风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是桔梗转世
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没什么了不起的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗不过是浪费四魂之力的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我椿 才够格拥有四魂之玉的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫做四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:46.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肩负着去除污秽与净化它的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跨越五十年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今四魂之玉成为我的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:15:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少在那里自以为是了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更多 还要更多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉还能放入更多力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.41,0:16:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渴望四魂之力的妖怪要多少有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将这些妖怪们统统吞进去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.61,0:16:28.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就能永恒不灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想利用四魂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将妖怪的力量吸进身体里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让她得逞的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 你也变成我的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让桔梗动心的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.81,0:16:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗无法驯服的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我来调教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用四魂之玉夺走你的理智好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种力量有什么了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 半妖？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你没有被这股力量夺去理智
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你污染了四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:31.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和桔梗完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了得到这股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜将一切舍弃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 椿 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 师父 椿无法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么四魂之玉不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是托付给桔梗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿认为自己不比桔梗差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见识一下我的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这股妖气会要你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:38.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:12.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我有这颗四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:38.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:40.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:54.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:58.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的青春渐渐流失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:02.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法留住青春
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然迅速老化了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时失去妖怪与四魂之力的椿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能恢复原本的姿态
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是哪里搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那半妖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个戈薇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我被奈落给耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不比桔梗差
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:32.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉不应该给桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.49,0:20:34.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该给我椿才对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我椿才是最厉害的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是黑巫女的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给各位添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.69,0:21:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是你们两位的错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要保重喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果大家都被奈落的计策耍的团团转
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是椿或我们都是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果四魂之玉 又原封不动回到奈落手上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对要抢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的没错 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经没力了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:41.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:45.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我多心了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执着于四魂之玉的椿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:53.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没有胜算可言
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执念吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没资格说别人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.03,0:22:20.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.87,0:22:26.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:33.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.52,0:22:40.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:47.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:53.92,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.67,0:23:01.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:07.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:14.61,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:21.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.83,0:23:27.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:34.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 冥加爷爷？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.45,0:23:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前老是躲我们躲的远远的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.55,0:23:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天怎么逃回我们这里了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:59.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚竟然袭击弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.23,0:24:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 犬夜叉也变得怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.46,0:24:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是大蜈蚣的诅咒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.73,0:24:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再会了 青春岁月
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是指谁的青春啊？
